      text "var fridgeIsOpen = false\nlet fridgeContent = [""milk"", ""eggs"", ""leftovers""]\n\nfunc fridgeContains(_ food: String) -> Bool {\n    fridgeIsOpen = true\n    defer {\n        fridgeIsOpen = false\n    }\n\n    let result = fridgeContent.contains(food)\n    return result\n}\nif fridgeContains(""banana"") {\n    print(""Found a banana"")\n}\nprint(fridgeIsOpen)\n// Prints ""false""."
